#: blocks/listing-calendar/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Month calendar view showing event listings by date."
msgstr "Maandkalender met vermeldingsgebeurtenissen per datum."

#: blocks/listing-card/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Displays a single listing as a card with image, rating, meta fields, and "
"favorite button."
msgstr ""
"Toont één vermelding als kaart met afbeelding, beoordeling, metavelden en "
"favorieteknop."

#: blocks/listing-categories/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Display listing categories in a grid with icons and listing counts."
msgstr "Toont vermeldingscategorieën in een raster met pictogrammen en aantallen."

#: blocks/listing-detail/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Displays full listing details with gallery, tabs, contact info, business "
"hours, and reviews."
msgstr ""
"Toont volledige vermeldingsdetails met galerij, tabbladen, contactgegevens, "
"openingstijden en beoordelingen."

#: blocks/listing-featured/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Display featured or top-rated listings in a horizontal carousel."
msgstr ""
"Toont uitgelichte of topgewaardeerde vermeldingen in een horizontale "
"carrousel."

#: blocks/listing-grid/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Displays listing search results in a responsive grid, list, or split view "
"with pagination."
msgstr ""
"Toont vermeldingszoekerresultaten in een responsief raster, lijst of "
"gesplitste weergave met paginering."

#: blocks/listing-map/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Interactive map showing listing locations with markers, clustering, and "
"search integration."
msgstr ""
"Interactieve kaart met vermeldingslocaties, markeringen, clustering en "
"zoekintegratie."

#: blocks/listing-reviews/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Displays reviews with rating summary, review list, submission form, helpful "
"votes, and owner replies."
msgstr ""
"Toont beoordelingen met beoordelingsoverzicht, beoordelingslijst, "
"indienvormulier, nuttige stemmen en antwoorden van eigenaren."

#: blocks/listing-search/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Search form with filters, keyword, location, and type selector for "
"directory listings."
msgstr ""
"Zoekvormulier met filters, trefwoord, locatie en typeselector voor "
"vermeldingen."

#: blocks/listing-submission/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Multi-step frontend listing submission form with type-driven fields, media "
"upload, and preview."
msgstr ""
"Meerstaps indienvormulier voor vermeldingen met typeafhankelijke velden, "
"media-upload en preview."

#: blocks/user-dashboard/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Frontend dashboard for listing owners — manage listings, reviews, "
"favorites, and profile."
msgstr ""
"Voorfrontenddashboard voor vermeldingseigenaren — beheer vermeldingen, "
"beoordelingen, favorieten en profiel."

